    {
      "source": "The main persistence API for relational databases in the Java world is certainly JPA, which has its own Spring Data module.\nWhy is there another one?",
      "translation": "Java 世界中关系数据库的主要持久化 API 无疑是 JPA，它拥有自己的 Spring Data 模块。那为什么还需要另一个呢？",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "JPA does a lot of things in order to help the developer.\nAmong other things, it tracks changes to entities.\nIt does lazy loading for you.\nIt lets you map a wide array of object constructs to an equally wide array of database designs.",
      "translation": "JPA 执行了大量操作以协助开发者。  \n其中一项功能是跟踪实体的变更。  \n它还为您实现延迟加载。  \n此外，它允许将各种对象结构映射到同样广泛的数据库设计模式。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This is great and makes a lot of things really easy.\nJust take a look at a basic JPA tutorial.\nBut it often gets really confusing as to why JPA does a certain thing.\nAlso, things that are really simple conceptually get rather difficult with JPA.",
      "translation": "这非常好，让很多事情变得异常简单。只需查看一个基础的 JPA 教程即可。  \n但 JPA 为何会执行某些操作，往往令人感到十分困惑。此外，一些在概念上非常简单的事情，在使用 JPA 时却会变得相当复杂。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data JDBC aims to be much simpler conceptually, by embracing the following design decisions:",
      "translation": "Spring Data JDBC 旨在通过遵循以下设计决策，在概念上实现更简单：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you load an entity, SQL statements get run.\nOnce this is done, you have a completely loaded entity.\nNo lazy loading or caching is done.",
      "translation": "加载实体时，会执行 SQL 语句。  \n完成此操作后，您将获得一个完全加载的实体。  \n不会进行延迟加载或缓存。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If you save an entity, it gets saved.\nIf you do not, it does not.\nThere is no dirty tracking and no session.",
      "translation": "如果您保存实体，它就会被保存。\n如果您不保存，它就不会被保存。\n没有脏数据跟踪，也没有会话。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "There is a simple model of how to map entities to tables.\nIt probably only works for rather simple cases.\nIf you do not like that, you should code your own strategy.\nSpring Data JDBC offers only very limited support for customizing the strategy with annotations.",
      "translation": "存在一种将实体映射到表的简单模型。  \n它可能仅适用于较为简单的情况。  \n如果您不喜欢这种方式，则应自行编写策略。  \nSpring Data JDBC 通过注解对自定义策略的支持非常有限。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
